#. module: spreadsheet_dashboard_documents
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:spreadsheet_dashboard_documents.spreadsheet_document_to_dashboard_view_form
msgid ""
"We're sending the original spreadsheet to the trash. No worries, though! You "
"can still make edits by heading over to the Dashboard configuration."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງຍ້າຍສະເປຣດຊີດຕົ້ນສະບັບໄປໃສ່ຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ. ແຕ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງເປັນຫ່ວງ! ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ ໂດຍການ"
"ເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ການກຳນົດຄ່າແຜງຄວບຄຸມ."
